<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FORE Systems cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FORE Systems cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz said it removed FORE Systems Inc from the recommended list and downgraded the stock to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, FORE said it expects to post first quarter net income of between $4.7 million and $6 million on revenues of between $95 million and $97 million.</p>
<p>-- said cut the fiscal 1998 earnings estimate to $0.35 a share from $0.55 a share and the fiscal 1999 estimate to $0.55 a share from $0.70 a share.</p>
<p>-- FORE lost 1/16 to 14-5/8.</p>
